WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:03.438
"You can do it, Mara!" Terrell yelled.

2
00:00:03.439 --> 00:00:05.953
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Rock Gym.

3
00:00:05.954 --> 00:00:09.998
They were rock climbing. Mara was almost at the top of a wall.

4
00:00:09.999 --> 00:00:12.490
"Grr!" She reached.

5
00:00:12.491 --> 00:00:16.180
Her fingers touched a hold. But then she slipped.

6
00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:19.635
A device lowered her slowly to the floor.

7
00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:24.795
"My turn!" Jack clipped himself to the rope.

8
00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:26.834
He started to climb.

9
00:00:26.835 --> 00:00:30.680
Then he looked down. He gulped.

10
00:00:30.681 --> 00:00:33.243
"What's wrong?" Terrell asked.

11
00:00:33.244 --> 00:00:37.414
"Um, I don't like high places," Jack said.

12
00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:42.043
"That's okay," Mara said. "Just come back down."

13
00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:44.003
Jack bit his lip.

14
00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:46.929
"Let go," Roxy said.

15
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.525
"I can't!" Jack said.

16
00:00:49.526 --> 00:00:52.595
"You won't get hurt," Terrell said.

17
00:00:52.596 --> 00:00:56.228
"Just let go. You can do it, Jack!"

18
00:00:56.229 --> 00:00:58.412
Jack closed his eyes and let go.

19
00:00:58.413 --> 00:01:00.448
He slowly came back down.

20
00:01:00.449 --> 00:01:02.458
He quickly unclipped himself.

21
00:01:02.459 --> 00:01:05.983
Terrell went next.

22
00:01:05.984 --> 00:01:09.950
He went halfway up the wall before coming back down.

23
00:01:09.951 --> 00:01:13.460
Then Roxy tried.

24
00:01:13.461 --> 00:01:17.005
She climbed high but got stuck close to the top.

25
00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:20.388
"I don't know which hold to grab next," she thought.

26
00:01:20.389 --> 00:01:25.589
"This isn't easy!" She let go and went back down to the floor.

27
00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:29.708
Jack was looking at his phone.

28
00:01:29.709 --> 00:01:33.406
"Whoa! Another person saw the rock man!"

29
00:01:33.407 --> 00:01:36.647
"Who's the rock man?" Roxy asked.

30
00:01:36.648 --> 00:01:40.606
"He's a monster in Mountain National Park," Mara said.

31
00:01:40.607 --> 00:01:43.784
"Lots of people saw him this weekend."

32
00:01:43.785 --> 00:01:48.627
Terrell shook his head. "There's no such thing as the rock man."

33
00:01:48.628 --> 00:01:53.337
"Oh yeah?" Jack held out his phone. "Check out this video!"

34
00:01:53.338 --> 00:01:54.910
Everyone looked.

35
00:01:54.911 --> 00:01:57.046
Roxy saw a large figure.

36
00:01:57.047 --> 00:01:59.733
It seemed to be made of rocks.

37
00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:01.977
It ran through a forest.

38
00:02:01.978 --> 00:02:06.052
Terrell shrugged. "It's just a person in a costume."

39
00:02:06.053 --> 00:02:08.955
"No way!" Mara said.

40
00:02:08.956 --> 00:02:13.103
"It's the rock man! What do you think, Roxy?"

41
00:02:13.104 --> 00:02:17.205
Roxy scratched her head. "I don't know."

42
00:02:17.206 --> 00:02:20.177
Just then her watch beeped.

43
00:02:20.178 --> 00:02:23.086
Jack and Mara were still looking at Jack's phone.

44
00:02:23.087 --> 00:02:24.950
Roxy whispered to Terrell.

45
00:02:24.951 --> 00:02:28.686
"I'll be right back. Mayor Bloom needs me."

46
00:02:28.687 --> 00:02:33.037
Terrell grinned. "Maybe he needs you to fight the rock man."

47
00:02:33.038 --> 00:02:36.518
Roxy chuckled.

48
00:02:36.519 --> 00:02:41.890
She stepped away from her friends and opened her watch.

49
00:02:41.891 --> 00:02:44.913
"Hi, Mayor Bloom." She smiled.

50
00:02:44.914 --> 00:02:47.865
"Is this about the rock man?"

51
00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:50.204
"No," Mayor Bloom said.

52
00:02:50.205 --> 00:02:55.073
"This is serious. There was an avalanche on Grand Peak yesterday."

53
00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:59.335
"Oh no!" Roxy said. "Is everyone okay?"

54
00:02:59.336 --> 00:03:01.853
"I don't know," Mayor Bloom said.

55
00:03:01.854 --> 00:03:03.927
"There were some climbers on the mountain.

56
00:03:03.928 --> 00:03:05.809
Most of them are fine.

57
00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.438
But one climber is still missing.

58
00:03:08.439 --> 00:03:13.393
His name is Bill. Can you help the rescue workers search for him?"

59
00:03:13.394 --> 00:03:20.938
"Of course, Mayor," Roxy said. "I'm on my way!"

